{"sha": "ed49c5c8a2224546bbe75a0b796cd83d03f1982f572a6007eea66fe44e26ca21", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:integration} 章 --- 积分}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:integration:1}", "$\\int_0^1 \\frac{\\dd t}{\\sqrt{t(1-t)}}$：在 $0$ 附近，$\\sim t^{-1/2}$", "（$\\alpha = \\frac12 < 1$：收敛）；在 $1$ 附近，$\\sim", "(1-t)^{-1/2}$：收敛。故积分收敛（其值为 $\\pi$，由", "换元 $t = \\sin^2\\theta$ 得）。", "", "$\\int_1^\\infty \\frac{\\ln t}{t^2}$：$\\frac{\\ln t}{t^2} = o(t^{-3/2})$：", "收敛（分部积分可得其值为 $1$）。", "", "$\\int_0^\\infty \\frac{\\dd t}{1 + t^2\\sin^2 t}$：发散。在 $t =", "n\\pi$ 附近，记 $t = n\\pi + u$，则 $\\sin^2 t = \\sin^2 u \\leq u^2$，于是在", "$\\abs u \\leq \\frac{1}{n}$ 上，$1 + t^2\\sin^2 t \\leq 1 + (n\\pi +", "1)^2u^2 \\leq C n^2 u^2 + 1$；因此", "\\[", "\\int_{n\\pi - 1/n}^{n\\pi + 1/n} \\frac{\\dd t}{1 + t^2\\sin^2 t}", "\\geq \\int_{-1/n}^{1/n} \\frac{\\dd u}{1 + Cn^2u^2}", "= \\frac{2\\arctan\\sqrt C}{\\sqrt C}\\cdot\\frac{1}{n} ,", "\\]", "这是一个发散的调和型级数的项，对 $n$ 求和时", "原函数无界。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:integration:2}", "作换元 $u = \\lambda t$：", "\\[", "\\int_0^\\infty t^n \\eu^{-\\lambda t}\\dd t", "= \\frac{1}{\\lambda^{n+1}}\\int_0^\\infty u^n\\eu^{-u}\\dd u", "= \\frac{\\Gamma(n+1)}{\\lambda^{n+1}} = \\frac{n!}{\\lambda^{n+1}} .", "\\]", "取 $t = \\eu^{-u}$（$\\dd t = -\\eu^{-u}\\dd u$）：", "\\[", "\\int_0^1 (\\ln t)^n \\dd t = \\int_0^{\\infty} (-u)^n \\eu^{-u}\\,\\dd u", "= (-1)^n\\, n! .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:integration:3}", "收敛性：被积函数 $\\leq \\frac{1}{1+t^2}$（在 $\\infty$ 附近），", "在 $0$ 附近有界（两个因子在远离 $0$ 时有正下界）：", "对每个 $x$ 绝对收敛。作换元 $t = \\frac1u$", "（$\\dd t = -\\frac{\\dd u}{u^2}$）：", "\\[", "I(x) = \\int_0^\\infty \\frac{1}{\\bigl(1 +", "\\frac1{u^2}\\bigr)\\bigl(1 + u^{-x}\\bigr)}\\cdot\\frac{\\dd u}{u^2}", "= \\int_0^\\infty \\frac{u^x}{(1 + u^2)(1 + u^x)}\\,\\dd u .", "\\]", "将 $I(x)$ 的两种表达式相加得：", "\\[", "2I(x) = \\int_0^\\infty \\frac{1 + t^x}{(1+t^2)(1+t^x)}\\dd t", "= \\int_0^\\infty \\frac{\\dd t}{1 + t^2} = \\frac{\\pi}{2} :", "\\]", "故 $I(x) = \\frac\\pi4$，与 $x$ 无关。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:integration:4}", "在 $0^+$ 附近，记 $u = \\abs{\\ln t} \\to \\infty$。若 $\\alpha < 1$，", "则不论 $\\beta$ 取何值均收敛（与 $t^{-\\alpha'}$ 比较，", "其中 $\\alpha < \\alpha' < 1$，对数因子被压制）。若 $\\alpha > 1$，", "则不论 $\\beta$ 取何值均发散（与 $t^{-\\alpha''}$ 比较，", "其中 $1 < \\alpha'' < \\alpha$）。若 $\\alpha = 1$，作换元 $t =", "\\eu^{-u}$：", "\\[", "\\int_0^{1/2} \\frac{\\dd t}{t\\,\\abs{\\ln t}^\\beta}", "= \\int_{\\ln 2}^{\\infty} \\frac{\\dd u}{u^\\beta},", "\\]", "当且仅当 $\\beta > 1$ 时收敛。综上，收敛当且仅当 $\\alpha < 1$，", "或（$\\alpha = 1$ 且 $\\beta > 1$） --- 恰与贝特朗", "级数形成对照。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:integration:5}", "在 $\\intco{0}{\\infty}$ 上的连续性：以", "$\\bigl|\\frac{\\eu^{-xt}}{1+t^2}\\bigr| \\leq \\frac{1}{1+t^2}$ 为控制函数，", "它可积，且关于 $x \\geq 0$ 一致成立，", "由\\cref{thm:b2:integration:continuity}可得。", "", "$C^2$ 在 $\\intoo{0}{\\infty}$ 上：当 $x \\geq a > 0$ 时，关于 $x$ 的前两阶", "导数 $\\frac{-t\\,\\eu^{-xt}}{1+t^2}$ 与", "$\\frac{t^2\\eu^{-xt}}{1+t^2}$ 分别被 $t\\,\\eu^{-at}$ 与", "$\\eu^{-at}$ 控制，连续两次应用", "\\cref{thm:b2:integration:leibnizrule}。于是", "\\[", "F''(x) + F(x) = \\int_0^\\infty \\frac{t^2 + 1}{1 + t^2}\\,\\eu^{-xt}\\dd", "t = \\int_0^\\infty \\eu^{-xt}\\dd t = \\frac1x .", "\\]", "极限：$0 \\leq F(x) \\leq \\int_0^\\infty \\eu^{-xt}\\dd t = \\frac1x \\to", "0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:integration:6}", "在 $\\intcc{\\varepsilon}{M}$ 上，", "于两段中分别作换元 $u = at$ 与 $u = bt$，即：", "\\[", "\\int_\\varepsilon^M \\frac{f(at) - f(bt)}{t}\\dd t", "= \\int_{a\\varepsilon}^{aM}\\frac{f(u)}{u}\\dd u", "- \\int_{b\\varepsilon}^{bM}\\frac{f(u)}{u}\\dd u", "= \\int_{a\\varepsilon}^{b\\varepsilon} \\frac{f(u)}{u}\\dd u", "- \\int_{aM}^{bM} \\frac{f(u)}{u}\\dd u .", "\\]", "第一项：$f(u) = f(0) + o(1)$（$0$ 附近），且 $\\int_{a\\varepsilon}", "^{b\\varepsilon} \\frac{\\dd u}{u} = \\ln\\frac ba$，该项趋于", "$f(0)\\ln\\frac ba$。第二项：$f(u) \\to f(\\infty)$，计算相同，", "趋于 $f(\\infty)\\ln\\frac ba$。因此该广义积分", "收敛于 $\\bigl(f(0) - f(\\infty)\\bigr)\\ln\\frac ba$。", "", "取 $f(t) = \\eu^{-t}$（$f(0) = 1$，$f(\\infty) = 0$），$a = 1$，$b", "= 2$：", "\\[", "\\int_0^\\infty \\frac{\\eu^{-t} - \\eu^{-2t}}{t}\\dd t = \\ln 2 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", ""]}